                            <comment id="15329921" author="agura" created="Tue, 14 Jun 2016 17:13:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed. TC looks good. Please review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15331344" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 15 Jun 2016 08:10:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I have one concern: it seems that synchronization could be broken by this change: GridTaskWorker.onResponse process response while GridJobResultImpl.setOccupied is &apos;true&apos;, but now occupied flag can be reset (line 901) and then response can be processed asynchronously by affinity future listener.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also I added one more test to check affinityCall from client node where affinity cache is not configured.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15331890" author="agura" created="Wed, 15 Jun 2016 15:05:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed and merged into master branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
